    "detailed_description": "<h1>Basketball Pinball</h1><p></p><br><h1>Touchdown Pinball</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Enjoy World Soccer Pinball, choose your country and start the match to become the number 1 in the world.<br><br>Score goals and try not to make fouls on the playfield, get the highest possible score, become the MVP and win the match.<br><br>Discover all the secrets, complete all the missions and become best among your Friends, posting your high score on the online leaderboard.<br><br>- Arcade design.<br><br>- Set at the soccer World Cup.<br><br>- Multiball, Extraball, Skillshot, Jackpots...<br><br>- Reproduction with all the details, lights and sounds.<br><br>- 4 different cameras to choose from.<br><br>- Vertical gameplay.<br><br>- Online Leaderboard.",
    "about_the_game": "Enjoy World Soccer Pinball, choose your country and start the match to become the number 1 in the world.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nScore goals and try not to make fouls on the playfield, get the highest possible score, become the MVP and win the match.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDiscover all the secrets, complete all the missions and become best among your Friends, posting your high score on the online leaderboard.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Arcade design.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Set at the soccer World Cup.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Multiball, Extraball, Skillshot, Jackpots...<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Reproduction with all the details, lights and sounds.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- 4 different cameras to choose from.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Vertical gameplay.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Online Leaderboard.",
    "short_description": "Welcome to the Soccer World Cup on a Pinball!",
